			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ElytraServers/productive-tinker-io/compare/1.0.1...1.1.0\n\n## NEW\n\n- Added _Speed Upgrade_ and _Basin Upgrade_ in this mod, so that we can get rid of productivelib ones.\n- _Speed Upgrades_ can be further upgraded by crafting with any kind of ices. (EMI recipe supported)\n\n## Update\n\n- Textures are updated.\n\n## Technical\n\nIntroduced 2 new data components `productive_tinker_io:basin_upgrade` and `productive_tinker_io:speed_upgrade` to mark items with functionality of upgrades.\n\nYou can somehow get a max speed upgrade like `/give @p minecraft:stick[productive_tinker_io:speed_upgrade={recipeTimeFactor: 1.0}]`, where `recipeTimeFactor` is ranged from 0 to 1."
		},
